        "Content": "Mid terrace four bedroom house. \r\nSpacious and well laid out accommodation.\r\nSought after residential development convenient to amenities in Baldoyle, Portmarnock and Sutton.\r\nPremier primary and secondary schools in the area.\r\nWell serviced by public transport links to include DART at Baldoyle and multiple Dublin Bus routes.\r\nExtending to approximately 149 sq. m (1,603 sq. ft). \r\nSubject to a tenancy at a current rent of 17,400 per annum. \r\n\r\nThis property provides a mid terrace four bedroom house with a yard to the rear. The property is arranged over three storeys beneath a pitched roof. The property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 149 sq. m (1,603 sq. ft). \r\n\r\nThe property is subject to a tenancy at a current rent of 17,400 per annum."
